confirm_rollback.description:
The update of container **{guest}** (CT {vmid}) failed: {error}

The restore point `{snapshot}` was made right before the update: a snapshot, or a backup for containers with bind mounts. Rolling back restores the container to that state and starts it again; everything changed in the container since then is lost. Data on bind mounts is not part of it and stays as it is.

The host picks up the request within 5 minutes. The full log is in `/var/log/proxmox-host-monitor/guest-{vmid}.log` on the Proxmox host.
